<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-20318] Clarify intended return of ofd_intent_policy() in the no_glimpse_ast case</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20318</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;a8dcf372f4 ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-6179" title="Lock ahead - Request extent locks from userspace" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-6179"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-6179&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; llite: Implement ladvise lockahead")&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Changed 'goto out;' to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;GOTO(out, ELDLM_LOCK_ABORTED);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This looks as it was intended to be either (changes behaviour):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;GOTO(out, rc = ELDLM_LOCK_ABORTED);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;or (behaviour is unchanged):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;GOTO(out, rc);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
